PokittoLib (https://github.com/pokitto/PokittoLib), as stated in PokittoDisplay.cpp.
fontTiny, fontTight, palettePico and the other fonts copied from the library
are under these terms, except font3x5 and font5x7, which are the Gamebuino
Library's (LGPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.Gamebuino-fonts), and fontC64
(MikroElektronika). The compatibility layer's own code (pk_core, pk_glue, pk_libc,
pk_run, LibAudio, Synth.h) is the YP3 port's, GPL-2.0-or-later, written
against the library's API.

